                "_key": "school-policies-intro-text",
                "_type": "span",
                "text": "Our school policies are designed to ensure a safe, respectful, and well-structured learning environment for all members of the school community. Aligned with the Sharjah Private Education Authority (SPEA) and international best practices, these policies provide clear expectations and guidelines that support student wellbeing, academic integrity, and effective school operations."
